{
  "format_version": 2,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "chapter": "playground",
  "conversations": {
    "playground_arrival": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "pa_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "pa_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "操场比院子大，也更安静。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_arrived",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.playground"
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "playground_arrived",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你穿过大门，进了小区后面的操场。它是开放的，很静。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "pa_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "一边是半开门的器材棚，远处是一整面布告栏，中间是一架旧的攀爬架，漆很久没补过了。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "playground_shed": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "ps_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ps_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "棚里堆着标志桶，一个放了气的球，一本封面被雨打过的记录册。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "look_closely",
              "text": "仔细看看。[细察]",
              "next": "ps_check"
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "算了。",
              "next": "ps_leave"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_check",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你探进去。里面是橡胶和纸的味道。",
          "check": {
            "id": "playground_shed_search",
            "ability": "keen_eye",
            "difficulty": 12,
            "modifier": 0,
            "visible": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_success",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "最后一页：和教室里一样的课表格式，但科目那栏写着体育，地点是操场。有人把旧纸留下来了。",
          "conditions": {
            "all_flags": ["check_success:playground_shed_search"]
          },
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_shed_seen",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "playground_shed_timetable",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "在操场的棚屋里，你找到一页记录纸，用的是和教室同样的课表格式。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_failure",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "那一页太湿了。格子还在，墨水已经晕进该看字的地方。这个形状你认得，字不认得。",
          "conditions": {
            "not_flags": ["check_success:playground_shed_search"]
          },
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_shed_seen",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "playground_shed_wet_ledger",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你试着去读操场棚屋里的湿记录册。课表的形状在，细节没了。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_leave",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你退出来。桶堆保持原样。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_shed_seen",
              "value": true
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "playground_wall": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "pw_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "pw_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "一整面布告：丢钥匙的纸，两学期前的选拔名单，一张班级合影。名单里没有你的名字。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "recall",
              "text": "努力想想。[回想]",
              "next": "pw_check"
            },
            {
              "id": "scan",
              "text": "看看别的通知。",
              "next": "pw_scan"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "pw_check",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你盯着照片，盯到人不再是人。",
          "check": {
            "id": "playground_wall_memory",
            "ability": "recollection",
            "difficulty": 10,
            "modifier": 0,
            "visible": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "pw_success",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "最后一排，左二。和课表画上一样的发型，但年纪大了。你分不清这是记忆还是暗示。",
          "conditions": {
            "all_flags": ["check_success:playground_wall_memory"]
          },
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_wall_seen",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "playground_wall_recall",
              "source": "recalled",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "在操场布告栏的班级合影里，你似乎认出一张脸，但不确定。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pw_failure",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "什么也没来。照片留在原地，你也留在原地。也许这样更好。",
          "conditions": {
            "not_flags": ["check_success:playground_wall_memory"]
          },
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_wall_seen",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "playground_wall_no_memory",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你在操场布告栏的合影前站了一会儿，没有想起什么。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pw_scan",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "选拔名单被改过太多次，最后的队伍已经看不清。丢钥匙的纸还在，钥匙还没找到。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_wall_seen",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "playground_wall_notices",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "操场布告栏上贴着旧的选拔名单和丢钥匙的通知，都没有结果。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "playground_equipment": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "pe_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "pe_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "攀爬架在这里很久了。有一根横杆是温的，尽管晒不到太阳。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "feel",
              "text": "凭直觉。[直觉]",
              "next": "pe_check"
            },
            {
              "id": "steady",
              "text": "稳住，再看一次。[定力]",
              "next": "pe_steady"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "pe_check",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你把手放到温的那根杆子旁边，没碰到。",
          "check": {
            "id": "playground_equipment_sense",
            "ability": "gut_feeling",
            "difficulty": 13,
            "modifier": 0,
            "visible": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "pe_success",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "不是杆子。底下的水泥在存热，像下面的房间开太久刚关掉。看不到门。",
          "conditions": {
            "all_flags": ["check_success:playground_equipment_sense"]
          },
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_equipment_seen",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "playground_equipment_warmth",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "操场器械下面的水泥是温的，像下面有房间。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pe_failure",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "没感到新的东西。或者感到了，被你叫成没有，也差不多。这根杆子暂时就是杆子。",
          "conditions": {
            "not_flags": ["check_success:playground_equipment_sense"]
          },
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_equipment_seen",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "playground_equipment_bar",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你在操场器械前停了一下，决定先把那种热当成普通的事。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pe_steady",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你吸一口气，顺着架子看过去。温的那根杆子螺栓不一样：新一点，紧一点，像是被换过。",
          "check": {
            "id": "playground_equipment_steady",
            "ability": "steadiness",
            "difficulty": 11,
            "modifier": 0,
            "visible": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "pe_steady_success",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "换得很用心。有人想让它撑住。",
          "conditions": {
            "all_flags": ["check_success:playground_equipment_steady"]
          },
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_equipment_seen",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "playground_equipment_bolts",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "操场器械温的那根杆子螺栓是新的，像是特意换过。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pe_steady_failure",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "是螺栓。起固定作用。今天就先不把它想成别的。",
          "conditions": {
            "not_flags": ["check_success:playground_equipment_steady"]
          },
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_equipment_seen",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "playground_equipment_bolts_unclear",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你看了看操场器械的螺栓，把问题留到以后。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "playground_q_intro": {
      "default_source": "reported",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "pq_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "pq_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "所以你找到操场了。我还以为他们锁了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "pq_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "没有锁。"
        },
        {
          "id": "pq_3",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "是吗。好吧。要是听见球声，别去追。自从我在这里，它就没打过气。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "playground_q_after": {
      "default_source": "reported",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "pqa_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "pqa_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你把这一圈都走完了？布告栏终于记住你名字了？"
        },
        {
          "id": "pqa_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "没有。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_explored",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.playground_done"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
